'''Cat Transport''' ((株)にゃんこ運輸, ''(Kabu) Nyanko Un'yu'', '''(Stock) Cat Transport''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]].

==Effect==
Worker Cat Start Level UP (M): Worker Cat's initial level starts with +2.

